# p2-stations.drv - Phase 2 tour: the large orbital station (game table 88).
#
# Verifies: B5, station plating on the large cross-armed orbital station
#           (docs/hd/hulls.md, Census of the station types).
# Run:  python3 tools/drive/drive.py --script tools/drive/scripts/p2-stations.drv \
#           --out RUN_DIR --timeout 420 "--args=--size 1600 1200"
#       (FE2_HULL_LOG=1 in the environment prints the model 88 lines.)
# Expect: exit 0; s00 to s39 a ladder of the approach under autopilot: the
#         first few far out, then the station from some 4 km (the target box
#         prints the distance), about 2.5 km, 800 m, the slot, and the last
#         shots docked. Screen capture runs unpaused and takes 1-30 s a shot
#         near the station, so which shot shows which distance varies by run.
# Start 2 (landed at a surface port of the fourth planet), new game only:
# part-exchange for the first ship in the list (it leaves cash), fit the
# automatic pilot and atmospheric shielding, request launch and lift off.
# On the system map zoomed in five steps the planet's orbital station is
# the label right of the planet; target it, engage the autopilot and click
# the 100x time icon once: the game drops back to 1x itself near the
# station, so the approach is slow enough to sample (1000x docks between
# two shots, and pausing for each shot stalls the approach far out).
wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 2
wait 11000
mouse 57 193
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 271 57
wait 300
click 200
wait 2500
mouse 171 146
wait 300
click 200
wait 3000
